      <div class="how-grid wh-steps">
        <div><b>Pick the wheel</b><p>Choose a style, finish and diameter. Our team confirms it suits your vehicle.</p></div>
        <div><b>Match the tires</b><p>Larger wheels usually mean a lower-profile tire, sized to keep the overall diameter close to stock.</p></div>
        <div><b>Mount and balance</b><p>Tires go on the wheels and are balanced as an assembly, with the TPMS sensors handled.</p></div>
        <div><b>Install and check</b><p>Wheels go on the vehicle, lug nuts are torqued to spec and fitment is checked.</p></div>
