      <details open><summary>Can I put any wheel on my vehicle?</summary><p>No. The bolt pattern, offset, center bore and clearance all have to work with your vehicle. That is why our team checks fitment before ordering.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do bigger wheels change my tires?</summary><p>Yes. A larger wheel usually takes a tire with a shorter sidewall. The goal is to keep the overall tire diameter close to stock so the speedometer and gearing stay accurate.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Will my TPMS sensors work with new wheels?</summary><p>The sensors can often be moved to the new wheels or replaced. Our team will go over the options when you ask for a quote.</p></details>
