<section id="pv-collect"><h2>1. Information we collect</h2><p>Outline of the categories of information collected: </p><ul><li>Forms: contact, quote requests and appointment / mobile booking details (name, phone, email, vehicle, ZIP, service requested).</li><li>SMS and email sign-ups: mobile number and email address, with the consent you give.</li><li>Analytics and cookies: device, browser and page-visit information.</li><li>Information you choose to send us, such as photos you submit for the gallery.</li></ul><p><span class="lg-ph">[Attorney to complete]</span></p></section><section id="pv-use"><h2>2. How we use information</h2><p>Outline of purposes: responding to quotes and bookings, scheduling service, sending confirmations and reminders, improving the site, and (with consent) marketing. <span class="lg-ph">[Attorney to complete]</span></p></section><section id="pv-share"><h2>3. How we share information</h2><p>Outline of service providers and other disclosures (scheduling, messaging, email, financing applications handled by Kafene, analytics), and legal requests. <span class="lg-ph">[Attorney to complete]</span></p></section><section id="pv-sms"><h2>4. Text messaging</h2><p>Text messaging outline: you opt in by providing your number and agreeing on a form; message frequency varies; <b>message &amp; data rates may apply</b>; reply <b>STOP</b> to opt out and <b>HELP</b> for help; consent is not a condition of purchase. <span class="lg-ph">[Attorney to complete]</span></p></section><section id="pv-cookies"><h2>5. Cookies and analytics</h2><p>Outline of cookie categories (necessary, analytics, marketing), how to manage them in your browser, and how we treat browser opt-out signals. <span class="lg-ph">[Attorney to complete]</span></p></section><section id="privacy-choices"><h2>6. Your Privacy Choices</h2><p>Outline of rights and choices available to residents (access, deletion, correction, opt-out of sale / sharing, limit use of sensitive data) and how to submit a request. <span class="lg-ph">[Attorney to complete]</span></p><div class="lg-choice" id="pv-choice-box">
