</div></section><section id="pv-retention"><h2>7. Data retention and security</h2><p>Outline of how long information is kept and the safeguards used. <span class="lg-ph">[Attorney to complete]</span></p></section><section id="pv-children"><h2>8. Children&rsquo;s privacy</h2><p>This site is not directed to children, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children. <span class="lg-ph">[Attorney to complete]</span></p></section><section id="pv-changes"><h2>9. Changes to this policy</h2><p>How updates are posted and dated. <span class="lg-ph">[Attorney to complete]</span></p></section><section id="pv-contact"><h2>10. Contact us</h2><p>Extreme Tires, 7712 West Oakland Park Blvd, Sunrise, FL 33351 &middot; (954) 773-1896. Privacy request contact: <span class="lg-ph">[Attorney / Simon to confirm]</span></p></section>
