<section id="ac-commit"><h2>1. Our commitment</h2><p>Extreme Tires wants everyone to be able to find tire, wheel and service information and to request a quote or appointment. We are working to make this website usable by people with a wide range of abilities and assistive technologies.</p></section><section id="ac-standards"><h2>2. Standards and target</h2><p>Our <b>target</b> is to meet the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1 Level AA. This is a goal, not a certification: <span class="lg-ph">[target &mdash; verify via independent audit]</span>.</p></section><section id="ac-measures"><h2>3. What we are doing</h2><ul><li>Keyboard-operable navigation, forms and dialogs, with visible focus.</li><li>Headings, landmarks and labels intended for screen readers.</li><li>Text contrast and resizable text; motion that respects reduced-motion settings.</li><li>Alternative text for meaningful images.</li></ul><p>Items above describe design intent for the prototype and need confirmation in an audit. <span class="lg-ph">[Attorney to complete]</span></p></section><section id="ac-known"><h2>4. Known issues</h2><p>Known issues list: <span class="lg-ph">[To be completed after audit]</span></p></section><section id="ac-help"><h2>5. Need help or want to report a barrier?</h2><p>Call us at <b>(954) 773-1896</b> during store hours (Mon&ndash;Fri 8:00 AM&ndash;6:30 PM, Sat 8:00 AM&ndash;4:00 PM, Sun closed) and we will help you get the information or service you need, or use the <a href="#contact" data-view-link="contact"><b>contact page</b></a>. Please tell us the page and the problem you ran into.</p></section><section id="ac-review"><h2>6. Last reviewed</h2><p>This statement was last reviewed on <span class="lg-ph">[Date]</span>.</p></section>
